{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Tower Survivor is a top-down, tower-defense game with survival elements set during a zombie apocalypse. Customize a magic tower with various talents and upgrades to fend off the undead. As the zombie waves grow stronger, refine your defensive strategies and adapt to the increasing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/684a233eef229546806d43275ab179e2.avif?t=1773081486\" width=836 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump right into the action \u2014 choose your tower, which defines its unique features, main ability, and difficulty level. The tower shoots the zombies automatically, so you can focus on buying the upgrades and collecting treasure chests. The game is perfect for all experience levels. Just relax and immerse yourself in a survivor-like gameplay loop that's sure to boost your dopamine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/808d11b527b9406737b3e90ba8a54cf8.poster.avif?t=1773081486\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/808d11b527b9406737b3e90ba8a54cf8.webm?t=1773081486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/808d11b527b9406737b3e90ba8a54cf8.mp4?t=1773081486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are ready for more, <strong>jump into Endless Mode</strong> where the waves never stop and the zombies keep getting stronger. Survive as long as you can and <strong>climb the global leaderboard</strong> to see how your build compares to players around the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/98d4fd03e7dc8bd69c141845bbd11820.avif?t=1773081486\" width=836 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on five increasingly tough difficulty levels. Your mission: survive each level and eliminate as many undead as possible within 20 minutes. Test out different combinations to conquer each difficulty level and kill every single zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As zombies grow stronger, your tower must too! Use gold to buy a wide range of upgrades from the shop, which you can access anytime during the level. Enhance your defense with talents, buffs, auras, and effects. Open treasure chests as you play to get free upgrades. Collect skulls dropped by zombies and complete achievements to unlock new towers, upgrades, and talents for deeper build variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/448a8ef31466dc59c6d95ab56f0f0fea.poster.avif?t=1773081486\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/448a8ef31466dc59c6d95ab56f0f0fea.webm?t=1773081486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/448a8ef31466dc59c6d95ab56f0f0fea.mp4?t=1773081486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/extras/e8d2f8c604e7755dd17605b7b89a273d.avif?t=1773081486\" width=836 height=138 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two play sessions are the same. With plenty of upgrades, abilities, and towers to choose from, you can mix and match to create a unique strategy each time. Unlock everything to explore different combinations and find the best way to beat the zombies. Create a game plan that\u2019s perfectly yours and discover the ultimate ways to pass all difficulty levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of main abilities, with even more on the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play with\u00a0various towers boosted through the meta-progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect skulls and complete achievements to unlock extra upgrades and talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with\u00a0hundreds of upgrades, talents, buffs, auras, and effects\u00a0to customize your tower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on Endless Mode and survive wave after wave with no time limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard and prove your strategy is the strongest </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique builds every time you play</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934480?t=1773081486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934480?t=1773081486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/dfc5d05d27c5a58f5d874d92e5dcff80a60f91c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773081486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934480/dfc5d05d27c5a58f5d874d92e5dcff80a60f91c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773081486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descripto